## COMMUNICATION
By regulating alkyl chain length of quantum dots, a balance between surface dipole induced charge coulomb repulsive force and quantum tunneling distance is achieved to maximize charge extraction and transfer at perovskite/carbon interface. The inorganic \(\mathsf{CsPbBr}_3\) PSC yields a champion efficiency as high as \(10.85\%\) with a \(V_{\infty}\) of \(1.626\:\mathrm{V}\).
